---
<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} image={heroImage} structuredData={pageStructuredData}>
  <main class="fnt-hub">
    <section class="hub-hero">
      <div class="hub-hero-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">THE BUY BETTER FINDS BRAND HUB</p>
        <p class="kicker">Phone protection, organized by how you use it</p>
        <h1>FNTCASE Review & Phone Case Buying Guide</h1>
        <p class="intro">From rugged cases with ring stands to magnetic designs and belt-clip holsters, this hub brings FNTCASE options together in one place. Start with your phone model, then compare the features and trade-offs that matter to you.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a class="button primary" href={affiliate(collection)} target="_blank" rel="sponsored noopener noreferrer">Browse FNTCASE cases ↗</a>
          <a class="button secondary" href={guide}>Read our comparison guide</a>
        </div>
        <p class="disclosure">Buy Better Finds may earn a commission from qualifying purchases through links on this page. This guide is based on manufacturer-published information; we have not independently tested these cases.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="hub-hero-image"><img src={heroImage} alt="FNTCASE rugged phone case with ring-style stand and holster" fetchpriority="high" /></div>
    </section>

    <section class="style-section">
      <div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">START WITH YOUR PRIORITY</p><h2>Shop by case style</h2><p>Think about how you carry your phone before choosing a design.</p></div>
      <div class="style-grid">
        <a class="style-card" href={affiliate(collection)} target="_blank" rel="sponsored noopener noreferrer"><span class="style-number">01</span><h3>Rugged protection</h3><p>Explore multi-layer styles and raised-edge designs. Check dimensions and the exact model listing.</p><span class="card-link">Explore rugged cases ↗</span></a>
        <a class="style-card" href={affiliate(collection)} target="_blank" rel="sponsored noopener noreferrer"><span class="style-number">02</span><h3>Magnetic cases</h3><p>For compatible magnetic accessories, verify magnet placement and wireless-charging compatibility.</p><span class="card-link">Explore magnetic cases ↗</span></a>
        <a class="style-card" href={affiliate(collection)} target="_blank" rel="sponsored noopener noreferrer"><span class="style-number">03</span><h3>Ring stands & kickstands</h3><p>Useful for grip support and hands-free viewing; consider added bulk and stand positioning.</p><span class="card-link">Explore stand styles ↗</span></a>
        <a class="style-card" href={affiliate(collection)} target="_blank" rel="sponsored noopener noreferrer"><span class="style-number">04</span><h3>Belt-clip holsters</h3><p>Consider clip orientation, holster fit, and whether the complete setup suits your daily carry.</p><span class="card-link">Explore holster cases ↗</span></a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="featured-section">
      <div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">A FEW OPTIONS TO COMPARE</p><h2>Featured FNTCASE listings</h2><p>These examples make it easier to compare common styles. Availability, pricing and supported variants can change.</p></div>
      <div class="product-grid">
        {products.map((product) => <article class="product-card">
          <a class="product-image" href={affiliate(product.url)} target="_blank" rel="sponsored noopener noreferrer"><img src={product.image} alt={product.name} loading="eager" decoding="async" /></a>
          <div class="product-copy">
            <p class="product-type">{product.type}</p>
            <h3>{product.name}</h3>
            <p class="device"><strong>Device:</strong> {product.device}</p>
            <p>{product.detail}</p>
            <a class="product-cta" href={affiliate(product.url)} target="_blank" rel="sponsored noopener noreferrer">Check product details ↗</a>
          </div>
        </article>)}
      </div>
      <p class="small-note">Images and product descriptions are provided for shopping orientation. Confirm that each image, product title, selected variant and phone model match before ordering.</p>
    </section>


    <section class="storefront-section" id="fntcase-store">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <p class="eyebrow">THE FNTCASE MINI STOREFRONT</p>
        <h2>Shop FNTCASE phone cases</h2>
        <p>Browse these selected FNTCASE listings by case style or phone model. Use the search and filters to narrow the options, then confirm the exact device variant, included accessories and current price on the retailer's page.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="store-controls" aria-label="Filter FNTCASE products">
        <label class="store-search"><span>Search products</span><input id="fntcase-product-search" type="search" placeholder="Search by phone model or feature..." /></label>
        <label><span>Case style</span><select id="fntcase-category-filter"><option value="all">All styles</option>{[...new Set(storeProducts.map((product) => product.category))].map((category) => <option value={category}>{category}</option>)}</select></label>
        <label><span>Sort by</span><select id="fntcase-product-sort"><option value="featured">Featured</option><option value="name">Name: A to Z</option></select></label>
      </div>
      <p class="store-count" id="fntcase-product-count" aria-live="polite">{storeProducts.length} products shown</p>
      <div class="store-product-grid" id="fntcase-product-grid">
        {storeProducts.map((product) => <article class="store-product-card" data-category={product.category} data-name={product.name.toLowerCase()} data-description={(product.description + ' ' + product.device).toLowerCase()}>
          <a class="store-product-image" href={affiliate(product.url)} target="_blank" rel="sponsored nofollow noopener noreferrer"><img src={product.image} alt={product.name} loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></a>
          <div class="store-product-copy">
            <span class="store-product-type">{product.category}</span>
            <h3>{product.name}</h3>
            <p class="store-device"><strong>Device:</strong> {product.device}</p>
            <p>{product.description}</p>
            <span class="store-price">Check current price</span>
            <a class="store-product-link" href={affiliate(product.url)} target="_blank" rel="sponsored nofollow noopener noreferrer">View product at FNTCASE ↗</a>
          </div>
        </article>)}
      </div>
      <p class="store-empty" id="fntcase-no-products" hidden>No products match that search. Try another keyword or choose “All styles.”</p>
      <div class="store-footer">
        <p>Prices, colors, compatibility and availability can change. Product details should be confirmed on the exact listing before purchase.</p>
        <a class="store-all-link" href={affiliate(collection)} target="_blank" rel="sponsored nofollow noopener noreferrer">Browse all FNTCASE products ↗</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="check-section">
      <div><p class="eyebrow">BEFORE YOU BUY</p><h2>Use this quick compatibility checklist.</h2></div>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Confirm the exact phone:</strong> model name, generation, size and camera layout.</li>
        <li><strong>Review what's included:</strong> front frame, built-in screen protector, holster and other accessories may vary.</li>
        <li><strong>Check everyday fit:</strong> pocket bulk, button access, charging and magnetic accessory needs.</li>
        <li><strong>Read current terms:</strong> confirm price, shipping, returns and stock on the product page.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="guide-cta">
      <p class="eyebrow">NEED HELP CHOOSING?</p><h2>Compare the details before you decide.</h2>
      <p>Our FNTCASE deep dive breaks down case styles, trade-offs and practical compatibility checks.</p>
      <a class="button primary" href={guide}>Read the FNTCASE deep dive ↗</a>
    </section>
  
<section class="bbf-seo-faq" aria-labelledby="bbf-seo-faq-title">
  <h2 id="bbf-seo-faq-title">FNTCASE: Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
  <article><h3>What is FNTCASE known for?</h3><p>FNTCASE offers phone cases and accessories in styles that include rugged protection, magnetic designs, ring kickstands and belt-clip holsters. Check the exact listing for supported phone models and included features.</p></article>
  <article><h3>How do I choose an FNTCASE phone case?</h3><p>Start with your exact phone model, then compare protection style, materials, magnetic compatibility, stand or holster features, dimensions and return terms.</p></article>
  <article><h3>Does Buy Better Finds personally test every FNTCASE case?</h3><p>No. This brand guide is a research-based buying resource. We compare published product details and practical considerations; it should not be read as a claim that every case has been personally tested.</p></article>
</section>
</main>

<script>
  const fntcaseGrid = document.querySelector('#fntcase-product-grid');
  if (fntcaseGrid) {
    const cards = Array.from(fntcaseGrid.querySelectorAll('.store-product-card'));
    const search = document.querySelector('#fntcase-product-search');
    const category = document.querySelector('#fntcase-category-filter');
    const sort = document.querySelector('#fntcase-product-sort');
    const count = document.querySelector('#fntcase-product-count');
    const empty = document.querySelector('#fntcase-no-products');
    const filterProducts = () => {
      const term = (search?.value || '').trim().toLowerCase();
      const selectedCategory = category?.value || 'all';
      const visible = cards.filter((card) => {
        const matchesCategory = selectedCategory === 'all' || card.dataset.category === selectedCategory;
        const matchesTerm = !term || (card.dataset.name + ' ' + card.dataset.description).includes(term);
        card.hidden = !(matchesCategory && matchesTerm);
        return !card.hidden;
      });
      if (sort?.value === 'name') {
        visible.sort((a, b) => a.dataset.name.localeCompare(b.dataset.name));
      } else {
        visible.sort((a, b) => cards.indexOf(a) - cards.indexOf(b));
      }
      visible.forEach((card) => fntcaseGrid.appendChild(card));
      if (count) count.textContent = visible.length + (visible.length === 1 ? ' product shown' : ' products shown');
      if (empty) empty.hidden = visible.length !== 0;
    };
    search?.addEventListener('input', filterProducts);
    category?.addEventListener('change', filterProducts);
    sort?.addEventListener('change', filterProducts);
  }
</script>

</BaseLayout>

<style>
.fnt-hub{--navy:#10233f;--red:#c8102e;--ink:#1d2733;--muted:#596574;max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;padding:24px 22px 64px;color:var(--ink)}
